<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<xliff xmlns="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2" version="1.2">
  <file original="modules/ledgerdirect" source-language="en" target-language="es" datatype="plaintext">
    <body>
      <trans-unit id="9a7e58ee13cb727cb7c4acc68f4cafe5">
        <source>Settings saved.</source>
        <target state="translated">Ajustes guardados.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="c82dc7fd19f357edc6f36e1898d8c408">
        <source>The receiving address is not a valid XRPL address. It starts with "r" and contains no 0, O, I or l.</source>
        <target state="translated">La dirección de recepción no es una dirección XRPL válida. Empieza por "r" y no contiene 0, O, I ni l.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="960a1ea0e70d7e3437a3a37a0f2bd242">
        <source>Enter a receiving address, or disable every payment method. Without an address there is nowhere for the money to go.</source>
        <target state="translated">Introduzca una dirección de recepción o desactive todos los métodos de pago. Sin dirección, el dinero no tiene ningún destino.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="2ac42d4009bbe404a17e0ec8dc4b1c24">
        <source>Choose either mainnet or testnet.</source>
        <target state="translated">Elija mainnet o testnet.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="5baeee2ff8f055dfc686538c7288e769">
        <source>The quote validity must be between %d and %d seconds.</source>
        <target state="translated">La validez de la cotización debe estar entre %d y %d segundos.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="63950aa871999109e98ab72e4b2f7f1f">
        <source>Receiving address</source>
        <target state="translated">Dirección de recepción</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="8564365509b1b04d5c348aa1ccd6434e">
        <source>Your XRPL account. Customers pay to this address, each order identified by its own destination tag.</source>
        <target state="translated">Su cuenta XRPL. Los clientes pagan a esta dirección y cada pedido se identifica por su propia destination tag.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="eec89088ee408b80387155272b113256">
        <source>Network</source>
        <target state="translated">Red</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="c245e370703d1700b92821320e90a2bb">
        <source>Testnet (no real funds)</source>
        <target state="translated">Testnet (sin fondos reales)</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ae99a835487548e7bc19edfe8ed2f9e4">
        <source>Mainnet (live)</source>
        <target state="translated">Mainnet (en producción)</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="24e2c74689dc9c7ce41e8f4e15dfd81a">
        <source>The receiving address must belong to the selected network. A mainnet address holds no funds on testnet and the other way round.</source>
        <target state="translated">La dirección de recepción debe pertenecer a la red seleccionada. Una dirección de mainnet no tiene fondos en testnet, y viceversa.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="623a9a4ce99b5852ef3c1e09b8ac4dd1">
        <source>Accept %s</source>
        <target state="translated">Aceptar %s</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="93cba07454f06a4a960172bbd6e2a435">
        <source>Yes</source>
        <target state="translated">Sí</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="bafd7322c6e97d25b6299b5d6fe8920b">
        <source>No</source>
        <target state="translated">No</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="058b7002c86a63ccab7761d533af6e7d">
        <source>Quote validity (seconds)</source>
        <target state="translated">Validez de la cotización (segundos)</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="2383283f5b9add5920c770c5391e9674">
        <source>How long the exchange rate shown to a customer stays fixed. Once it lapses the customer is asked to refresh the amount; the destination tag stays the same.</source>
        <target state="translated">Cuánto tiempo permanece fijo el tipo de cambio mostrado al cliente. Una vez caducado, se pide al cliente que actualice el importe; la destination tag no cambia.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="da9d58e0413e0b137baacd5a83b28dbd">
        <source>XRP Ledger settings</source>
        <target state="translated">Ajustes del XRP Ledger</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="c9cc8cce247e49bae79f15173ce97354">
        <source>Save</source>
        <target state="translated">Guardar</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="b70a36683e27a793f8d76faf3e9f957e">
        <source>The native asset of the XRP Ledger. Needs no trustline.</source>
        <target state="translated">El activo nativo del XRP Ledger. No necesita trustline.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="c870979c352522e626446da53760f035">
        <source>Your account needs a %s trustline to the issuer below before it can receive payments — without one they will fail on the ledger. The issuer is fixed and cannot be changed here. %s</source>
        <target state="translated">Su cuenta necesita una trustline de %s hacia el emisor indicado abajo antes de poder recibir pagos: sin ella fallarán en el ledger. El emisor es fijo y no se puede cambiar aquí. %s</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="bf5914f1d90be1298863aa286b6bab1b">
        <source>Payment confirmation</source>
        <target state="translated">Confirmación de pago</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="b356f4f21ec4cf7684f00b2b3d24dfbc">
        <source>Call this URL from a cron job every few minutes. It confirms payments for customers who closed the payment page. Keep the token secret.</source>
        <target state="translated">Llame a esta URL desde un cron cada pocos minutos. Confirma los pagos de los clientes que cerraron la página de pago. Mantenga el token en secreto.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="e26be2f47d89a72f288f1ebfd22cdcbe">
        <source>LedgerDirect</source>
        <target state="translated">LedgerDirect</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="8ba44f563b2829ab670db530d325903c">
        <source>Accept XRP, RLUSD and USDC directly on the XRP Ledger.</source>
        <target state="translated">Acepte XRP, RLUSD y USDC directamente en el XRP Ledger.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="68ebbb61167073564b61ca77dc280a60">
        <source>XRPL payment</source>
        <target state="translated">Pago XRPL</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="46a2a41cc6e552044816a2d04634545d">
        <source>State</source>
        <target state="translated">Estado</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="fcdf8a82eba24e303b63b2e49a507ecb">
        <source>Requested</source>
        <target state="translated">Solicitado</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ac5bb077c33753116b5e91ff1766e7bc">
        <source>Received</source>
        <target state="translated">Recibido</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="94325723d5b29917a78736901daf7ca7">
        <source>another currency or issuer</source>
        <target state="translated">otra moneda u otro emisor</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="a860ed9926b241b7d4dca2d00610ab2c">
        <source>Outstanding</source>
        <target state="translated">Pendiente</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="fac82bcd0e45d6bf7cf224ab3819fcd2">
        <source>Destination tag</source>
        <target state="translated">Destination tag</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="44b9f225ed451d483a93110fad204a5c">
        <source>Transactions on this destination tag</source>
        <target state="translated">Transacciones en este destination tag</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="63bd34f1308e37824df5b8129ba1397e">
        <source>None yet.</source>
        <target state="translated">Ninguna todavía.</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="14a94a99755c5fcd7c23335bacb4c7b8">
        <source>no delivered amount</source>
        <target state="translated">sin importe entregado</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="e0010a0a1a3259ab5c06a19bad532851">
        <source>Paid</source>
        <target state="translated">Pagado</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="d46e9766487850eb77acf3268228f323">
        <source>Partially paid</source>
        <target state="translated">Pagado parcialmente</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="d1dde637dd9eed89d33766eb9fe70ad6">
        <source>Paid in the wrong token — not credited</source>
        <target state="translated">Pagado en el token equivocado — no acreditado</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="be031a11e9b69da4e60ca1352c1cfeff">
        <source>Quote expired, nothing received</source>
        <target state="translated">Cotización caducada, nada recibido</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="8b36249c00d04fa8cf0ee475d1e21078">
        <source>Waiting for payment</source>
        <target state="translated">Esperando el pago</target>
      </trans-unit>
    </body>
  </file>
